        "id": 7210,
        "name": "Vex85",
        "username": "Vex85",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/90ced4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-02-15T20:47:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I google &nbsp;for my issue and use the search function here, and was on bbg - but I dindt find an answer so I need to ask it and hopefully you can help me :) .</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Phase Villian - End of the Turn</p><p>Card: Opeartive</p><p>Reveal Cards until the an Underboss comes&nbsp;</p><p>--&gt; I found 1 (any - doesent matter)</p><p>On the Card on the Underboss:</p><p>Put 1 e.g. Informant in play.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Is this correct ? So at the end of the Villian turn (when the op. is active) - she \"spawns\" an Underboss AND the UNderboss \"spawns\" a Thug?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Or&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Will just only an Underboss get spawned by the Operative and (if there are no other cards in play) finish.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hope I put my Issue clear.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Its about: I am at the End of the Villian turn, and now are coming cards into play which have effects in \"End of the villian turn\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>BEst Regards from Germany</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Stefan</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:25.888Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
