        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I google &nbsp;for my issue and use the search function here, and was on bbg - but I dindt find an answer so I need to ask it and hopefully you can help me :) .</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Phase Villian - End of the Turn</p><p>Card: Opeartive</p><p>Reveal Cards until the an Underboss comes&nbsp;</p><p>--&gt; I found 1 (any - doesent matter)</p><p>On the Card on the Underboss:</p><p>Put 1 e.g. Informant in play.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Is this correct ? So at the end of the Villian turn (when the op. is active) - she &quot;spawns&quot; an Underboss AND the UNderboss &quot;spawns&quot; a Thug?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Or&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Will just only an Underboss get spawned by the Operative and (if there are no other cards in play) finish.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hope I put my Issue clear.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Its about: I am at the End of the Villian turn, and now are coming cards into play which have effects in &quot;End of the villian turn&quot;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>BEst Regards from Germany</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Stefan</p>",
