        "id": 53103,
        "name": "pwatson1974",
        "username": "pwatson1974",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-02-15T21:15:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes, the Operative spawns an underboss who, when it's it's turn in the end phase, spawns a thug who then acts as well. There's a reason the Chairman is a level 4 villain.</p><p>As long as you're in the Start or end phase, you go through all the cards, even if they only appeared in that phase.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:27:11.893Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
