        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Yes, the Operative spawns an underboss who, when it&#39;s it&#39;s turn in the end phase, spawns a thug who then acts as well. There&#39;s a reason the Chairman is a level 4 villain.</p><p>As long as you&#39;re in the Start or end phase, you go through all the cards, even if they only appeared in that phase.</p>",
