        "created_at": "2013-02-15T21:19:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Are you still in the End of Turn phase? Yes.</p><p>Does the card have an End of Turn effect? Yes</p><p>Then it triggers whether it was played this turn or a previous turn</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And welcome from England!</p>",
